# 本机(以及本项目的目标用户网络)无法访问 github.com 的 release 下载,
# 实测 `curl https://github.com/electron/electron/releases/...` 直接超时,
# 而 registry.npmjs.org 正常 —— 所以只有二进制下载需要走镜像。
#
# electron 与 electron-builder 都经 @electron/get 下载二进制,它读 npm config
# 里的 electron_mirror。不配这一行,npm install 会以
# "TypeError: fetch failed" 结束,且 node_modules/electron/dist 为空。
electron_mirror=https://cdn.npmmirror.com/binaries/electron/
electron_builder_binaries_mirror=https://cdn.npmmirror.com/binaries/electron-builder-binaries/
